				<img height="283" src="img/lion020_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///C:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Kit_Prepaint/ARTPLA/Lion/img/lion020.jpg" --></a><a href="img/lion021.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/lion021_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///C:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Kit_Prepaint/ARTPLA/Lion/img/lion021.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
